[[0,1722909,0,1,0,1,"2017-03-16T01:29:49","KingMortales","",[],"<p>In this life we have a battle,</p>\n<p>And in the battle we each have our role.</p>\n<p>One day I am the general- calm, distant, away from the rattle;</p>\n<p>The next moment I’m barely still whole.</p>\n<p>Right in the trenches,</p>\n<p>Alive with every sensation:</p>\n<p>Fear, courage, pain, triumph, glory, mourning, then dull-</p>\n<p>All so vibrant in later contemplation.</p>\n<p>Through all of this my friends, and my allies,</p>\n<p>help me rise.</p>","This is one I actually presented out loud a month or two ago.","","OCpoetry"],[1,8431636,0,1,0,1,"2017-03-16T04:59:57","humblebumble","",[],"<p>Very good but I feel adding a final rhyme would help the flow of the ending out some. Such as: </p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>help me rise, into the skies</p>\n</blockquote>"]]
